sequenceDiagram
    participant C as WebSocket client
    participant S as Conversation session
    participant G as Dispatch gate
    participant I as Canonical ingress
    C->>S: new turn
    S-->>C: accepted
    S->>G: wait with generation execution window
    C->>S: re-authenticate and attach duplicate
    S-->>C: accepted / conversation_in_flight
    G->>I: dispatch once
    I-->>S: completion
    S-->>C: one delivered terminal result
